-- Modifier cards, wand order B (n2): Heavy Shot then Damage Plus. Twin of 111-modifiers.bqn (order sections). (was n2-modifiers-b)
-- The same two cards reversed: 16 where -a got 26. Order is meaning.
-- Same two cards as the -a twin, opposite order: 3*2+10 = 16 against 26. The barrier makes each card read the previous card's commit, so the wand slot order is the program.
-- Two Damage Plus in ONE barrier is the commuting case, the -c twin: the §10 additive-merge law gives 23; += beside *= admits no merge law and the compiler rejects the batch.
--! registry ../registries/111-modifiers.reg
--! expect damage = 0 16 16 16 8
--! expect speed = 0 4 4 4 2

SparkBolt , Damage *= 2 ; Speed -= 2
SparkBolt , Damage += 10
